  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Resources for Health Programme-Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the Zambian health system through the support of training, deployment and supervision of 3543 government health workers including community health workers, skilled birth attendants, biomedical engineering technicians and medical specialists as well as broader health system strengthening technical assistance.  This will contribute to the achievement of MDGs 4 and 5 through bringing life- saving interventions and prevention information closer to mothers and children (Nutsen)</narrative>
  </description>
